            A) 3 V
            B) 9 V  ← CORRECT  (0.75 × 12 V = 9 V)
            C) 12 V
            D) 15 V

        Q5. How does increasing the PWM duty cycle affect motor behavior?
            A) It increases the PWM frequency, which increases motor speed.
            B) It increases the average voltage delivered to the motor, increasing
